# NOTE (2026-10, migration/dashboard-vanilla-js): this vanilla-JS build reads no
# .env file at all -- there's no server/build step left to read one. The anon/
# publishable URL+key live as plain JS constants in assets/js/supabase-client.js,
# same convention public/client-app/index.html already uses (safe: anon tier
# only, RLS-scoped). The service_role key this file used to document
# (src/lib/supabase/service.ts) no longer exists in this branch on purpose --
# see assets/js/supabase-client.js's header comment and README.md's security
# section. .env.local is kept only for reference/history; it is not read by
# anything in this branch.

# Playwright smoke suite credentials (tests/dashboard.spec.js) -- real account,
# set locally/in CI only, never commit a value here:
TEST_ACCOUNTANT_EMAIL=
TEST_ACCOUNTANT_PASSWORD=
